    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. A report on local level election from GESI perspectives at place.
2. 150 people from GESI groups capacitated in leadership development, candidacy, campaign, GBV in the election and overall electoral process. 
3. 50 ECN staff &amp; other stakeholders trained on gender and inclusion issues. 
4. 150 election officials and electoral stakeholders trained on electoral procedures for House of Representative and Provincial Assembly elections.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Preparing a pictorial report with facts and figures on local level election 2022. 
2. 213 (Women: 198) people from GESI groups capacitated in leadership development, candidacy, campaign, GBV in the election and overall electoral process. 
3. 60 (Women: 13) ECN staff trained on EEIC operation and media management and stress management. 
4. Altogether 214 (Women: 53)government officials and electoral stakeholders trained on election procedural trainings, among them 53 were women.
5. 143 potential women leaders capacitated on election procedure, communication and election campaign management.
6. 13,026 people reached through voter education with mock polling.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
